
    NetHack version 5.0.0 [work-in-progress]

Options compiled into this edition:

    I32LP64 data model, color, end-of-game dumplogs, insurance files for
    recovering from crashes, live logging support, log file, extended log
    file, errors and warnings log file, news file, internal pager used for
    viewing help files, pattern matching via :PATMATCH:, pseudo random
    numbers generated by ISAAC64, strong PRNG seed from /dev/urandom,
    restore saved games via menu, screen clipping, traditional status
    display, status via windowport with highlighting, suspend command, show
    stack trace on error, save and bones files accepted from version 5.0.0
    only, and basic NetHack features.

Supported windowing system:

    "and" (Android).

